    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT CANNIBAL TALES!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><i>Chicago, 1999</i></strong><br>A newspaper editor waits for a reporter to deliver a documentary about an expedition in Borneo to find the last cannibals. The man does not show up, but an envelope is delivered to his office. It contains a bloodstained videotape and a concise message: <br><br>\u201cIt is not the video you were expecting, but I think you will be satisfied anyway. Try to enjoy your last night.\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/2003db7e7ee5936bd0f83f4b980507f2.avif?t=1737109445\" /></div><br><br>Who is threatening you? <br>What happened to the reporter? <br>And why do the members of the expedition seem to have mysteriously disappeared?<br><br>You only have one night to find the answers, relying solely on the information in the video.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/771568904a4ce9071282e4fcf7169e12.poster.avif?t=1737109445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/771568904a4ce9071282e4fcf7169e12.webm?t=1737109445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Borneo is a horror thriller, containing stories of necrophilia, murders, metropolitan cannibals, <br>and psychopathic embalmers.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Chicago, 1999</i></strong><br>A newspaper editor waits for a reporter to deliver a documentary about an expedition in Borneo to find the last cannibals. The man does not show up, but an envelope is delivered to his office. It contains a bloodstained videotape and a concise message: <br><br>\u201cIt is not the video you were expecting, but I think you will be satisfied anyway. Try to enjoy your last night.\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/2003db7e7ee5936bd0f83f4b980507f2.avif?t=1737109445\" /></div><br><br>Who is threatening you? <br>What happened to the reporter? <br>And why do the members of the expedition seem to have mysteriously disappeared?<br><br>You only have one night to find the answers, relying solely on the information in the video.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/771568904a4ce9071282e4fcf7169e12.poster.avif?t=1737109445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286420/extras/771568904a4ce9071282e4fcf7169e12.webm?t=1737109445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Borneo is a horror thriller, containing stories of necrophilia, murders, metropolitan cannibals, <br>and psychopathic embalmers.",
